<TXSPN>"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s gaze ended on a patrol car, stopped in front of the apartment building.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey! We're hiding!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> got off her bicycle and slipped straight into the shadow of the bike shed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't you get it? High school students are under a stay-at-home order today. We get caught, we get in trouble, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s lead we </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="なら">follow</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">ed; </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I both shrank down in the bike shed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="4">, in that case all those high school students at the park are getting in trouble, aren't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s retort: no reaction from </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
"Police in a place like this... what on earth did they come for?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That would be door-to-door questioning, wouldn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, right, door-to-door questioning."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動車エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Before long the patrol car drove off in the opposite direction from us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Without even sounding its siren, it went slowly off into the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ていじろ">T-junction</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at the end of the road.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We went into the entrance hall and I pressed the elevator button.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Door-to-door questioning, huh... Which means they probably came to my place too..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="4">, you're awfully bothered about it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? Ah, no, it's just, if it's the police I might have got all sorts of new information, right? Too bad..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then why did you hide just now?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Like I said, we get in trouble if we're out, right? Meeting the police outside and meeting them at home are completely different."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well... I suppose so."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\エレベーター.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
