{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Pardon the intrusiooon!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the moment we reached </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s place, went bustling inside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I'll put the black tea on, so have a seat."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Okaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> answered cheerfully, and</STYLE>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1"> sat down on the sofa with a whump.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, you sit down too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I lowered myself down slowly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> turned the television on without asking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The midday news seemed to be on.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes, this is live from the scene in Motoki-cho."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed to be a report on the incident in Chuo Park.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"According to information just received, the victim is believed to be male. However, the body was found with the skin of the whole body </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> away, and the identity is still unknown."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ooh! My reasoning was right on target! Operation successful!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　munch munch..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> raised her voice happily.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In her hand was the sakiika I had brought over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How anyone can be delighted at hearing about a flayed body...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">On the television, the studio personality and the announcer at the scene were talking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"There's information that the victim was still alive when first found; is that true?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes. According to the person who found the body and to other witnesses, there was still breath at the time of discovery. However, it is believed that death came before the police arrived. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That said, the estimated time of death and the time of discovery almost coincide, so I think there is every possibility that, as the testimony says, the victim was still alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There seemed to be nothing particularly new.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, I should say it had not been released yet.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "700" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was from a number I didn't know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed to be coming from a landline inside the town.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The area code was the one I was used to seeing.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, aren't you going to answer?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm, it's from some number I don't know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For an instant I </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ちゅうちょ">hesitat</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">ed to answer, but I took a breath and slowly tapped the smartphone.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes... hello?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, are you getting along with </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. I wondered who it was."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"My cell phone's battery died after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">A little while ago there was a call from </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">It seems there was an incident over there, he said, and was everyone all right."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahh, so it made the news in Hokkaido too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, he was worried, so I told him the two of us here are both fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, got it, yeah, bye then."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">She had probably called from the phone at her workplace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, really. She doesn't charge it properly..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I lifted my head, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was standing in front of me, without my noticing when.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Her expression was strangely hard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And in it, something terribly sad―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">I could make out a face close to tears.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... could you show me the number that called?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? It's this one...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I handed the smartphone to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, sorryyy, can you bring the tea over?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, coming now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I stood up,</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
