<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\五島がなつみに抱き着く.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Short little </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> threw her arms around me and held tight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With real strength, as if clinging on.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"G-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? What's wrong? Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What startled me more was</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\se_maoudamashii_se_heartbeat01.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s heartbeat, frighteningly strong.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it's all right. I'll come too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'll be with you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never slackened her grip, and pressed her heart against me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, whatever happens... please keep a firm hold of yourself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's wrong? Where are we going?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
